    "name": "Virtual patients: drug dosing and anaesthesia",
    "description": "A whole-body physiologically based pharmacokinetic (PBPK) model of twenty drugs in virtual patients. Two simulators on one engine: a bedside where you dose one patient, watch the side effects and correct them with other drugs, and an anaesthesia room where you take a patient through an operation, intensive-care sedation or a therapeutic coma and are scored on it — plus population trials and dose finding.",
